- system_script: Iterates component_script, executes Luau scripts on Heartbeat
- system_audio: Iterates component_transform + component_audio, updates 3D audio positions
- system_light: Iterates component_light, updates renderer light list

Systems run on the job system. system_render runs on main thread (OpenGL context). Others can run on worker threads.

