### 6.2 Luau Bindings

Bind C++ engine APIs to Luau using Luau's C API. Create userdata wrappers for engine objects.

Key bindings:
- game global (equivalent to Roblox's game)
- workspace global
- script global (current script reference)
- Vector3, CFrame, Color3, UDim, UDim2, Ray, Region3 types
