### 6.3 f3d Framework (Luau Standard Library)

Provide a built-in Luau framework at src/engine/scripting/f3d_framework/ that is auto-loaded into every script context.

init.lua -- Bootstraps the framework, sets up globals, imports all modules.

vector3.lua -- Vector3 type with methods: new(x, y, z), Magnitude, Unit, Dot, Cross, Lerp, Floor, Ceil, Abs, Max, Min, Angle, Project, Reject, Reflect, Rotate, FuzzyEq, Lerp, Slerp. Metamethods for +, -, *, /, ==, tostring.

cframe.lua -- CFrame (Coordinate Frame) type: position + orientation. Methods: new(pos), new(pos, look_at), Angles(rx, ry, rz), ToEulerAngles, ToOrientation, Inverse, Lerp, ToWorldSpace, ToObjectSpace, PointToWorldSpace, PointToObjectSpace, VectorToWorldSpace, VectorToObjectSpace, GetComponents. Metamethods for *, +, -, ==, tostring.

color3.lua -- Color3 type: new(r, g, b), from_rgb(r, g, b), from_hsv(h, s, v), Lerp, ToHSV. Properties: R, G, B.

run_service.lua -- Provides RunService equivalent with Heartbeat, RenderStepped, Stepped callbacks.

sound_service.lua -- SoundService for playing sounds with PlaySound and PlaySoundAtPosition.

lighting_service.lua -- LightingService for controlling ambient, brightness, clock_time, fog.

input_service.lua -- InputService for InputBegan, InputEnded, MouseButton1Down, etc.

tween_service.lua -- TweenService for animations with Create, Play.

fmod_wrapper.lua -- Abstracts FMOD/miniaudio backend with PlayEvent, SetParameter, LoadBank, PlayOneShot.

### 6.4 Script Execution Model

- Scripts run in separate Luau threads (coroutines)
- Heartbeat callback runs every frame with auto-computed delta_time
- RenderStepped runs before rendering
- Stepped runs before physics step
- Scripts can yield with wait(seconds) or task.wait(seconds)
- Infinite loop protection: interrupt hook after 1,000,000 instructions, warning logged
- Script errors are caught and logged to console, script continues if possible

