Implement all standard operations: addition, subtraction, scaling, dot product, cross product, normalization, length, distance, lerp, slerp, matrix multiplication, matrix-vector multiplication, matrix inversion, quaternion multiplication, quaternion-to-matrix, matrix-to-quaternion, etc.

