## 16. Game Runtime

The game runtime is a stripped-down executable that loads and runs a packaged game:

Methods:
- init(const string& game_path)
- run()
- shutdown()
- load_level(const string& level_path)
- unload_level()

The runtime:
1. Reads config.ini
2. Loads .pak archives
3. Decrypts (XOR) and mounts archives
4. Loads startup level
5. Initializes all systems (renderer, physics, audio, scripting)
6. Enters main loop
7. On exit: cleanup

No editor code is included in the runtime build.

