## 20. Key Design Principles

1. snake_case EVERYWHERE -- files, classes, functions, variables, macros
2. No CMake -- use Clang + vcpkg + batch/shell scripts
3. OpenGL primary, DX11/12 as TODO stubs
4. Roblox-style scene graph + ECS hybrid
5. Luau scripting with f3d framework
6. FMOD primary, miniaudio fallback -- engine not dependent on FMOD at compile time
7. macOS-like professional UI via Dear ImGui
8. Text-based .f3d scene format
9. XOR-encrypted multi-archive asset packing
10. Job system for multithreading
11. Custom Luau-like shader language compiling to GLSL
12. Jolt Physics for collision and simulation
13. Y-up, right-handed coordinate system
14. C++20 standard
15. Full in-engine editor -- game files don't contain editor data
